        }
      },
      "title": "How an item gets claimed (the hidden code)",
      "description": "### How an item gets claimed (the hidden code)\n\n**DSA topic:** 1. SHA-256 hashing\n\nIf the item is already claimed, a different phone is told so (that is what makes check 1 work).\nOtherwise the typed code is hashed with **SHA-256** (`hashClaim`) and compared with the stored hash. Only the person holding the real pack can know the code, because it is printed *inside* the pack."
    }
  ]
